# L-corner blocked-door + blocked-front-bumper exit test on blocked_exit overlay:
# Same Bulldog #1 approach as vault_blocked_car.probe, but hold SOUTH throttle
# until Bulldog #1 stops flush against the (129,132) L-corner wall ahead so BOTH
# east door (x=130) and south front bumper (129,132) are blocked, while west/north are clear.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80

17000 down right
+512 up right
+100 down up
+1950 up up
+100 down left
+256 up left
+100 down up
+400 up up
+100 shot start_corner
+50 tap enter 70
+2100 down up
+1650 up up
+700 down up
+450 up up
+350 shot pinned_corner
+50 burst blocked_corner_exit 140 0
+30 tap enter 70
+2100 shot after_blocked_corner
+100 quit
